WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.600 line:88%
Assalomu alaykum! Men Nilufar, «Shirin kun»
qandolatidan. Uyda tort pishirib, Instagramda sotaman.

2
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:13.526 line:88%
Bugun savdo nima ekanini va mijoz bilan
qanday gaplashishni ko‘rib chiqamiz.

3
00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:21.612 line:88%
Bir oyda menga 100 kishi yozdi, lekin faqat 20
tasi tort oldi. Qolgan 80 kishi qayerga ketdi?

4
00:00:21.832 --> 00:00:27.054 line:88%
Kech javob berdim, darrov narx
aytdim, «qimmat» deyishsa jim qoldim.

5
00:00:27.274 --> 00:00:33.101 line:88%
Endi tez javob beraman, avval so‘rayman
va bahslashmay variant taklif qilaman.

6
00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:39.854 line:88%
Savdo — omad emas, 7 ta qadam: mijozni
topish, salomlashish va so‘rash.

7
00:00:40.074 --> 00:00:44.689 line:88%
Keyin taklif qilish, savollarga
javob berish va kelishish.

8
00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:48.979 line:88%
Oxirgi qadam — xariddan
keyin ham aloqada qolish.

9
00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:53.087 line:88%
Eng ko‘p xato: so‘ramasdan
darrov narx aytish.

10
00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:59.294 line:88%
Dilnoza opa Instagramda tort
rasmini ko‘rib, qandolatga keldi.

11
00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:03.281 line:88%
— Assalomu alaykum!
Tortlaringiz narxi qancha?

12
00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:07.449 line:88%
— Va alaykum assalom! Men
Nilufar. Ismingiz nima?

13
00:01:07.669 --> 00:01:10.069 line:88%
— Dilnoza.

14
00:01:10.289 --> 00:01:14.844 line:88%
— Dilnoza opa, tort qanday
tadbirga va necha kishiga kerak?

15
00:01:15.064 --> 00:01:19.194 line:88%
Darrov narx aytilmadi —
avval ochiq savol berildi.

16
00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:25.220 line:88%
Ochiq savol mijozni gapirtiradi.
Avval vaziyatni so‘raymiz.

17
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.964 line:88%
Keyin muammoni: oldin nima yoqmagan edi?

18
00:01:29.184 --> 00:01:33.072 line:88%
Muammo hal bo‘lmasa nima
bo‘lishini so‘raymiz.

19
00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:37.483 line:88%
Oxirida yechimning foydasini
mijozning o‘zi aytadi.

20
00:01:37.703 --> 00:01:42.439 line:88%
Qoida: suhbatning 70 foizida
mijoz gapirsin, 30 foizida siz.

21
00:01:43.789 --> 00:01:47.253 line:88%
3-qadam: Nilufar so‘raydi va tinglaydi.

22
00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:51.603 line:88%
— O‘g‘limning tug‘ilgan
kuni, shanba kuni, 20 kishi.

23
00:01:51.823 --> 00:01:56.802 line:88%
— O‘tgan safar tort kech kelib,
mehmonlar oldida uyalib qolgandim.

24
00:01:57.022 --> 00:02:02.122 line:88%
— Tushundim: 20 kishi, shanba, vaqti
juda muhim. Soat nechaga kerak?

25
00:02:02.342 --> 00:02:04.742 line:88%
— Soat oltiga.

26
00:02:04.962 --> 00:02:10.426 line:88%
Nilufar eshitganini qaytarib aytdi —
mijoz uni tinglashganini his qildi.

27
00:02:11.776 --> 00:02:17.058 line:88%
Mijoz «tort nimadan?» deb emas, «bu
menga nima beradi?» deb o‘ylaydi.

28
00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:21.650 line:88%
Xususiyat: tort yetkazishdan
6 soat oldin pishiriladi.

29
00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:26.061 line:88%
Afzallik: shuning uchun u
yangi va yumshoq bo‘ladi.

30
00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:30.533 line:88%
Foyda: bu sizga mehmonlar
oldida xotirjamlik beradi.

31
00:02:31.883 --> 00:02:36.437 line:88%
Bitta narx aytsangiz, mijoz
faqat «ha» yoki «yo‘q» deydi.

32
00:02:36.657 --> 00:02:40.666 line:88%
3 ta variant bering:
oddiy, standart va premium.

33
00:02:40.886 --> 00:02:45.683 line:88%
Endi mijoz «qaysi biri?» deb
o‘ylaydi — tanlov uning qo‘lida.

34
00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:50.073 line:88%
— Standart biroz qimmatroq ekan...

35
00:02:50.293 --> 00:02:54.302 line:88%
Bahslashmang: «qimmat» —
rad javobi emas, savol.

36
00:02:54.522 --> 00:02:58.592 line:88%
— Tushunaman. Qancha atrofida
mo‘ljallagan edingiz?

37
00:02:58.812 --> 00:03:01.305 line:88%
— Ikki yuz ming atrofida.

38
00:03:01.525 --> 00:03:07.595 line:88%
— Unda oddiy tortga yozuv va shamlarni
qo‘shamiz — jami 220 ming. 20 kishiga yetadi.

39
00:03:07.815 --> 00:03:10.612 line:88%
— Ana bu menga to‘g‘ri keladi!

40
00:03:11.962 --> 00:03:16.395 line:88%
E’tirozga javob 5 qadam:
tinglang, tan oling, aniqlang.

41
00:03:16.615 --> 00:03:20.806 line:88%
Keyin dalil yoki boshqa
variant bilan javob bering.

42
00:03:21.026 --> 00:03:25.157 line:88%
Oxirida keyingi qadamni
so‘rang: «Davom etamizmi?»

43
00:03:26.507 --> 00:03:29.970 line:88%
6-qadam: kelishuvni bosimsiz yakunlash.

44
00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:35.654 line:88%
— Demak: shanba, soat oltida, yozuv
va shamlar bilan, 220 ming. To‘g‘rimi?

45
00:03:35.874 --> 00:03:38.274 line:88%
— To‘g‘ri!

46
00:03:38.494 --> 00:03:42.988 line:88%
— 50 ming oldindan to‘lasangiz,
buyurtmani yozib qo‘yaman.

47
00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:46.672 line:88%
Takrorlab tasdiqlash — eng halol yakun.

48
00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:51.022 line:88%
Yakshanba kuni Nilufar
o‘zi yozdi: «Tort yoqdimi?»

49
00:03:52.372 --> 00:03:56.563 line:88%
100 kishidan 20 tasi oldi
— bu konversiya, 20 foiz.

50
00:03:56.783 --> 00:04:01.398 line:88%
Har biri o‘rtacha 250 ming
to‘ladi — oyiga 5 million so‘m.

51
00:04:01.618 --> 00:04:06.778 line:88%
Yaxshi suhbat bilan 25 kishi olsa
— 6 million 250 ming. Reklamasiz!

52
00:04:08.128 --> 00:04:12.683 line:88%
Yangi mijoz topish eski mijozga
yana sotishdan qimmatroq.

53
00:04:12.903 --> 00:04:16.064 line:88%
Ertasi kuni so‘rang: tort yoqdimi?

54
00:04:16.284 --> 00:04:21.687 line:88%
Bir haftadan keyin fikr so‘rang, bir
oydan keyin yangi taklif yuboring.

55
00:04:21.907 --> 00:04:26.098 line:88%
Muhim sanada tabriklang —
mijoz sizni eslab qoladi.

56
00:04:27.448 --> 00:04:30.608 line:88%
Tez javob bering va avval so‘rang.

57
00:04:30.828 --> 00:04:35.443 line:88%
Foydani ayting, 3 variant
bering va «qimmat»dan qo‘rqmang.

58
00:04:35.663 --> 00:04:41.551 line:88%
Xariddan keyin ham aloqada qoling. Keyingi
mavzu — narxni shakllantirish. Omad!
